{"sourceUrl":"https://lxy.chd.edu.cn/info/1008/23560.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:45.865664+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://lxy.chd.edu.cn/info/1008/23560.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>长安大学理学院竭诚欢迎全国各高校优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试来我院攻读研究生。为做好</span>2026<span>年推荐免试研究生接收工作，现将预报名有关事宜通知如下。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、招生专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>070100</span><span><span>数学（硕士学术学位）</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>08</span><span>01</span><span>00</span><span><span>力学</span></span><span><span>（硕士</span></span><span><span>学术</span></span><span><span>学位</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>实际招生专业和研究方向以我校正式发布的</span>2026<span>年招生简章和专业目录为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. 2026<span>届普通全日制本科毕业生，有望取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.<span>身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、预报名</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>申请人于</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日后<a href=\"https://lxy.chd.edu.cn/info/1008/23560.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">登录长安大学推免生预报名系统（</a></span><a href=\"https://lxy.chd.edu.cn/info/1008/23560.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><a href=\"https://lxy.chd.edu.cn/info/1008/23560.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>http://49.233.141.142/xly/login</span><span>）填写有关信息、上传附件材料并提交申请。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>有意向申请我院</span><span>2026</span><span>年推免研究生的同学务必加</span><span>QQ</span><span>群：长安大学</span></span><span><span>理</span></span><span><span>学院</span>2026<span>年硕士研究生推免预报名群：</span></span><span>908790365</span><span><span>，并将群昵称改为姓名</span>+<span>专业</span><span>+</span><span>本科学校，其他后续工作将在群中通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、申请材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人将以下材料按照</span>1-6<span>项顺序整理成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件（不超过</span><span>10M</span><span>），上传推免生预报名系统：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>个人简历、身份证和学生证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>本科成绩单和总评成绩排名证明</span><span>(</span><span>由教务处盖章或所在学院盖章</span><span>)</span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>英语水平证明材料（</span><span>CET-4</span><span>、</span><span>CET-6</span><span>、</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>IELTS</span><span>等成绩单）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.<span>学术科研成果（公开发表的论文等）和获奖证书；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5.<span>参加社会实践、公益事业等的证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、资格审查与考核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>        1.</span><span><span>资格审核：我院将陆续对申请人报名信息进行资格初审，通过资格初审的申请人方可进入复试考核环节。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>        2.<span>考核工作：我院接收</span><span>2026</span><span>年推免生的具体复试内容和要求以学院后续通知为准</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>可</span></span><span><span>参照我院</span>2025<span>年复试安排。请申请人及时关注我院官网及</span><span>2026</span><span>推免预报名群（</span></span><span>908790365</span><span><span>）通知，保持手机畅通，并按要求参加考核工作。我院将根据申请者考核成绩择优录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>        3.<span>所有报考我校的推免生在取得所在学校的推免资格后，即可登录</span><span>“</span><span>全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统</span><span>”(</span><span>以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>，网址</span><span>:http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm)</span><span>填写报考志愿、接收并确认复试及待录取通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六、其他事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>        1.<span>未尽事宜请以长安大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生预报名通知为准，网址：</span><span><a href=\"https://yzb.chd.edu.cn/2025/0809/c2769a254078/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yzb.chd.edu.cn/2025/0809/c2769a254078/page.htm</a></span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>我校将根据教育部最新推免生政策，及时公布</span>2026<span>年接收推免生的最新信息，请关注我校研究生院网站相关信息。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>        2</span></span><span>.<span>建议申请人提前联系报考导师（导师简介及联系方式见学院官网：</span><span><a href=\"https://lxy.chd.edu.cn/szdw/bsdxx.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://lxy.chd.edu.cn/szdw/bsdxx.htm</a></span><span>），如对招生专业、报考过程、研究方向等信息有疑问，可在报名阶段咨询学院和导师。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>        3</span></span><span>.<span>未进行预报名的推免生届时可登录教育部</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>进行报名，我院将根据实际情况组织复试，具体安排以学院后续通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>        4</span></span><span>. <span>招生咨询报名与资料审核联系人：</span></span><span><span>敖</span></span><span><span>老师，联系电话：</span>029-8233</span><span>5302</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span>                                                            <span>理</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2025<span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"277c5042d5e6c216d1e7b9fdd5fa8abb35f86cfc88410f6242f4d1663a2f2fe4","textLength":1312,"sourceSha256":"faec2d55d5055127d16c9d8ad30f6cfa3a726173e3e1dca88d23856183fa85d9","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ad540732be720338b3c8","title":"2025年长安大学理学院2026年接收推荐免试研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:45.865664+00:00"}
